'''Jennella''' is a resident of [[Rellekka]]. She lives in a house just west of the main entrance. She also drops [[lyre]]s which can be used in [[The Fremennik Trials]], rather than having to make them with 25 [[Fletching]]. At level 45 [[Thieving]] and after [[The Fremennik Trials]], she can be [[Thieving#Pickpocketing|pickpocketed]] for 40 [[coins]] and 65 [[Thieving]] experience.

